# =============================================================================
# git-nt (Arch Rev 4.1) — Repository Ignore Rules
# =============================================================================
# IMPORTANT: Tracked Negative-Space tombstones live in `.nt/ns/` and MUST NOT
# be ignored here.

# --- Rust / Cargo ---
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
Cargo.lock.bak

# --- git-nt Local-Only Sensitive Telemetry (NEVER commit or push) ---
# Raw Tier 3 <think> reasoning traces and local scratchpads (AGENTS.md §2.6)
.nt-local/
*.think.txt
*.think.log
# Defensive ignore if a staging dir is ever created outside .git/
.nt-stage/

# --- Phase 1 Falsification Pilot & Local Benchmark Outputs ---
experiments/pilot/out/
experiments/pilot/.venv/
experiments/pilot/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/

# --- Temporary Test Repositories & Coverage Artifacts ---
/tmp/
*.profraw
*.profdata
lcov.info

# --- OS & Editor Artifacts ---
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.vscode/settings.local.json
.idea/
